<title>USA: Asahi, Corning, Samsung in pact.</title>
<headline>Asahi, Corning, Samsung in pact.</headline>
<dateline>CORNING, N.Y. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Glass Co Ltd of Japan, Corning Inc and the Samsung Group of South Korea said on Monday they agreed in principle to establish a television glass manufacturing facility in Mexico.</p>
<p>Ultimately, investment in the facility could exceed $300 million, the companies said. The plant would provide glass funnels and panels for color television tubes, they said.</p>
</text>
